WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.925
Hello, my name is Muskan. I am doing my PhD in Electronics

00:00:03.925 --> 00:00:07.546
and Communication Engineering at Presidency University,

00:00:07.546 --> 00:00:11.426
Bangalore. Currently I'm participating in semester exchange

00:00:11.426 --> 00:00:14.918
program at National Changhua University of Education,

00:00:14.918 --> 00:00:18.152
Taiwan which has been very enriching and valuable

00:00:18.152 --> 00:00:21.579
experience for me. During this exchange, I have been

00:00:21.579 --> 00:00:25.330
exposed to Advanced Research facilities, new technologies

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:29.210
and a highly collaborative academic environment. Apart from

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.250
this academics.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:34.090
This experience has helped me grow personally. I have met

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:37.930
students from different countries and learned about their

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:41.902
new cultures and traditions, and it helped me to improve my

00:00:41.902 --> 00:00:45.279
communication skills. Overall, this experience has

00:00:45.279 --> 00:00:48.590
broadened my perspective and improved my research

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:52.099
capabilities, and motivated me to work harder for my

00:00:52.099 --> 00:00:56.880
professional and academic goals. Thank you.